  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original fossil-study target: complete visible skeletal arrangement of genuine plateA PMO214.214, including long limbs, grasping digits and very long segmented tail. Not living furred animal or skull-only substitute. [\"Crushing, overlapping ribs/limbs and mineral coatings obscure elements. Do not invent missing bones as observed.\", \"Bone depth, backside and thin support geometry are display reconstruction, not CT-complete anatomy.\", \"31preserved caudals reported; last fragment at fault leaves possible1–2more unknown. Do not claim complete originaltailtip.\", \"Avoid definitive human-ancestor claims; use Eocene adapiform primate.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"published_approx_skeleton_length_m\": 0.58, \"published_approx_head_body_length_m\": 0.24, \"published_approx_skull_length_m\": 0.05, \"derived_tail_length_m\": 0.34, \"note\": \"Juvenile specimen dimensions; not adult living size. Curved skeletal length, not straight rectangular bounding box.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original fossil-study target: complete visible skeletal arrangement of genuine plateA PMO214.214, including long limbs, grasping digits and very long segmented tail. Not living furred animal or skull-only substitute. [\"Crushing, overlapping ribs/limbs and mineral coatings obscure elements. Do not invent missing bones as observed.\", \"Bone depth, backside and thin support geometry are display reconstruction, not CT-complete anatomy.\", \"31preserved caudals reported; last fragment at fault leaves possible1–2more unknown. Do not claim complete originaltailtip.\", \"Avoid definitive human-ancestor claims; use Eocene adapiform primate.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"published_approx_skeleton_length_m\": 0.58, \"published_approx_head_body_length_m\": 0.24, \"published_approx_skull_length_m\": 0.05, \"derived_tail_length_m\": 0.34, \"note\": \"Juvenile specimen dimensions; not adult living size. Curved skeletal length, not straight rectangular bounding box.\"}"
  },
